Package: silent-compose
Version: @VERSION@-@DEB_RELEASE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Almighty Shogun <alm1ghtyshogun1998@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.2), ibus (>= 1.5.0)
Homepage: https://shogun.ms
Description: Silent Compose input method for GTK 4 and IBus
 Silent Compose provides silent Windows-style US International composition. It
 includes a GTK 4 input-method module and an IBus engine named
 US, intl. Silent Compose. Pending accent keys are kept private and only final
 UTF-8 text is committed.
